---
description: Universal entrypoint pointer for this repo — read AGENTS.md and .ai/INDEX.md first
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` first, then `.ai/INDEX.md`, before making any change in this repository.

`AGENTS.md` is the agent-agnostic entrypoint: repo identity, prime directives, non-negotiable constraints, task execution loop, stop/ask conditions. `.ai/INDEX.md` maps every deeper doc, its token budget, and when to load it — load only what the current task needs.

Also load, as needed: `.ai/status.md` (current repo state), `.ai/agents/README.md` (role matrix), `.ai/commands/README.md` (command registry), `.ai/hooks/README.md` (expected behavior at each stage).

This file intentionally contains no separate rules of its own, to avoid drifting out of sync with `AGENTS.md`. If you find a rule here that contradicts `AGENTS.md`, `AGENTS.md` wins — report the contradiction rather than silently picking one.
